OL,3,GNEWSAAttempted murder arrest as teen
OL,4,Ahurt in hit-and-run
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man in his 20s has been arrested on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of attempted murder after a
OL,8,Fteenage boy was taken to hospital with
OL,9,Flife-changing injuries following a
OL,10,Fsuspected hit-and-run incident.
OL,12,FBedfordshire Police said it was called
OL,13,Fto reports that the boy was struck by a
OL,14,Fgrey Toyota CHR while he was walking
OL,15,Falong Dumfries Street, Luton, at about
OL,16,F17:00 GMT on Tuesday.
OL,18,FThe force said the vehicle failed to
OL,19,Fstop at the scene.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
